message: "If you use or adapt this pipeline, cite the software release and its author."
title: "Biohub Cell Tracking: Reproducible Training and Inference Pipeline"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Duckworth
    given-names: William
version: "0.957-reference"
date-released: 2026-09-11
abstract: >-
  A modular training and inference pipeline for 3-D fluorescence cell
  tracking, combining detector evidence, constrained graph construction,
  motion and gap repair, multi-branch division inference, ownership
  arbitration, continuation repair, cleanup, and topology validation.
keywords:
  - cell tracking
  - bioimage analysis
  - fluorescence microscopy
  - lineage reconstruction
  - graph optimization
  - reproducible research
